{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] [Bbmaj7] | [Eb] | [Bb] [Bbmaj7] | [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
These are [Bb]the names [F/A]of Aaron's [Bb]sons
Nadab [Eb]the firstborn [F]and Abi[Bb]hu
Elea[Gm]zar and Ithamar [F]serve
Anointed [Eb]priests ordained to [Gm]minister
But [Eb]Nadab and [F]Abihu [Bb]died
Offering unauthorized [F/A]fire before the [Gm]Lord
So Elea[Eb]zar and Itha[F]mar re[Gm]mained
Serving as [Eb]priests during [F]Aaron's [Bb]lifetime
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
The [Gm]Lord said to [Dm]Moses bring [Eb]forward
The [Gm]tribe of Le[Dm]vi to present [Eb]them
To [Gm]Aaron the [F]priest to assist [Eb]him
Carrying [Cm7]out duties for the whole con[Fsus4]gre[F]ga[Bb]tion
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
I myself have [F]taken the Levites
[Gm]In place of every [Dm]firstborn who opens [Eb]the womb
The Levites shall [Bb]be mine I am the [Eb]Lord
For every [Cm7]firstborn is [F]mine from the land of [Bb]Egypt
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Register the sons [F/A]of Levi by [Gm]name
[Eb]Gershon Kohath and [F]Merari their [Bb]clans
Count every male [Gm]a month old and [F]older
Moses reg[Eb]istered them at the com[Gm]mand of the Lord
To [Eb]Gershon belonged [F]Libni and Shi[Bb]mei
Their enrollment came to [F/A]seven thousand five [Gm]hundred
They [Eb]camped behind the [F]tabernacle [Gm]west
[Eb]Caring for [F]the tent and [Bb]its covering
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
I myself have [F]taken the Levites
[Gm]In place of every [Dm]firstborn who opens [Eb]the womb
The Levites shall [Bb]be mine I am the [Eb]Lord
For every [Cm]firstborn is [F]mine from the land of [Bb]Egypt
