{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
To Kohath be[F/A]longed Amram [Gm]and Izhar
[Eb]Hebron and Uz[F]ziel their clans al[Bb]so
Eight thou[Gm]sand six hundred cared for [F]the sanctuary
Guard[Eb]ing the ark and the [Gm]table and lampstand
To [Eb]Merari belonged [F]Mahli and [Bb]Mushi
Six thousand two hundred [F/A]cared for the [Gm]frames
They [Eb]camped on the north [F]side of the [Gm]tent
