{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
The [Gm]total number of Le[Dm]vites was twen-ty-two [Eb]thousand
[Gm]Moses and Aaron regis[Dm]tered them at the Lord's com[Eb]mand
[Gm]Register every first[Dm]born male of Is[Eb]rael
